[@1]
<h2>~rLord of Storm</h2>
<p>Our masters the Dark Lords wishes to reclaim the Isle of Geysers which you have disrespectfully taken.

[@2]
<h2>~mDuke of Thunder</h2> 
<p>HAH!!  NEVER!!!  We well defeat you and use the Isle to destroy your masters' empire!

[@3]
<p>I'm more worried about surviving!
<p>~I~lYour assesment of the situation is bleak...You are surrounded and outgunned..

[@4]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>Let us fight so we will not suffer the same fate as our other allies!

[@60]
<h2>~gLord of Thunder</h2>
<p>All the other rebellions we have crushed!!  What make you think your fate will be any different?

<h2>~mDuke of Thunder</h2> 
<p>Your fate is to meet my dagger!!

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Escape from the Dark Lords</h2>
<i>"Fear is the greatest weapon a person can have"<br>
--Rahn Nimbian General</i>  
<p>Soon after your victory over the Guardian of Isle of Geysers....you and your clan has been attacked by the powerful Dark Lords.  Many of your allies have been killed or captured, now only you and a handful of your allies remain.  You must fight your way to saftey!  Before your enemies receive renforments and crush you under their feet.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
Congratulations! You and your friends have escaped with your lives.....but for how long?
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Dark4

[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>
Keep it up....we may still survive this yet!

[ai2PriestDead]
<h2>~mDuke of Thunder</h2>
<p>
Good Job!  Victory is moments away!

[ai2PriestCaptured]
<h2>~rStorm Lord</h2>
<p>
You won't have the chance to kill me!  My Army will destroy you!

[ai3TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~lKing of Rain</h2>
<p>
You won't be able to stop me!  Withdraw now and I might be merciful.

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>The King of Rain has perished</h2>
<p>
Only a matter of time now before another falls before your millitary genius!

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~gLord of Thunder</h2>
<p>
Your are just lucky! but your luck will not last!

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>~mDuke of Thunder</h2>
<p>
With him dead our task will become easier.

[ai5TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~mDuke of Thunder</h2>
<p>
They have gotten through!  I'm under attack!

[ai5PriestCaptured]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>
Quick, we must help our friend!

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Duke of Thunder has died!</h2>
<p>
Soon after the Duke of Thunder fell, your ally the Knight of Wind and you soon fell upon the incoming onslaught.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai6TempleDead]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>
He was weak...the others won't be so easy to destroy.

[ai7TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>
I am in need of your help my friend!

[ai7PriestCaptured]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>
Hurry, I don't have much time left!

[ai7PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally the Knight of Wind has died!</h2>
<p>
As the Knight of Wind died, the Duke of Thunder made an attack.  Unfortunatly he failed and you both were captured.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai8PriestDead]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>
Our south flank is almost clear.....

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
The Dark Lords have won.  You and your clan is captured and doomed.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[END]

